v0.14 preserves same-update marker deduplication for RIGHT, LEFT, and OFF.
Dedup key: actor + RIGHT/LEFT slot snapshot + motion + marker + action + phase + state time; wall window <= 5 ms.

Authored-occurrence budgets are cached separately for RIGHT, LEFT, and OFF.
Budget key: actor + RIGHT/LEFT slot snapshot + motion + action + phase; state-time rollback starts a new execution.
